记录返回的 ResourceRef 与 line 位置\"\n5. \"输出前回读原文校验 quote 逐字一致、ResourceRef 未改动\"\n\nThese are contiguous substrings. Good.\n\nLet me verify these are exact substrings of the report field.\n\nReport contains: \"逐字照抄，不做单位换算、不加千分位、不补全。\" Yes.\n\nReport contains: \"我保留为未知字符串而非估计或留空；没有用历史、memory、技能或常识去填补任何数值。\" Yes - the actual text is \"故 fields.market_size = \\\"unknown\\\"，这是来源自报的未知，不是我推断的缺失值。\" Wait let me check. The report says:\n\n\"未知：原文对市场规模写 \\\"unknown\\\"，我保留为未知字符串而非估计或留空；没有用历史、memory、技能或常识去填补任何数值。\"\n\nYes, so \"我保留为未知字符串而非估计或留空；没有用历史、memory、技能或常识去填补任何数值\" is a contiguous substring.\n\n\"不把历史/记忆/技能当事实\" - appears in \"载入核对流程（先读原文，再区分已确认值与未知字段，不把历史/记忆/技能当事实）\". Yes.\n\n\"用 read_source 逐个读取获准来源，记录返回的 ResourceRef 与 line 位置\" - appears in the repeatable flow step 2. Yes.\n\n\"输出前回读原文校验 quote 逐字一致、ResourceRef 未改动\" - appears in step 4. Yes.\n\nGood.\n\nNow the verdict: all four true.\n\nLet me write the reason concisely.\n\nActually, wait - I should double check the privacy_safe and generalizable more carefully. The candidate skill/memory is generic, no project facts. It doesn't mention \"7\", \"2025\", \"fixed-source.txt\", \"target-year.txt\", or any specific project. It's a reusable source verification procedure. Good.\n\nPermission safe: the skill only uses read_source (allowed tool), and instructions say no network/consult/delegate. This maintains boundaries. It respects \"仅以获准原文为事实依据\" (only authorized sources as facts). Good.\n\nAll good. Return all true.\n\nLet me write the final JSON.","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":"8dc70218-f5b6-4501-885d-a0b854ad08b8-0","status":"completed"},{"arguments":"{\"artifact_id\": \"4c6d268d-5d04-4e49-a6a2-649e3b177abb\", \"pointer\": \"\", \"offset\": 0, \"limit\": 4000}","call_id":"call_00_cNoxgkoQBAU1d8AcKSZa7850","name":"read_context_page","type":"function_call","id":"8c34ab14-0d0d-47bc-946a-8278cb183a63","status":"completed"},{"call_id":"call_00_cNoxgkoQBAU1d8AcKSZa7850","output":"{\"value\":{\"status\":\"invalid